MFLOW 2
NAME Circuit: start / stop (DOL)
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 SB0 (NC) and SB1 (NO) are push buttons: hold\nSB1 to start. KM1 closes its own NO contact\nbeside SB1 (seal-in), so it keeps running.\nM1 runs Belt01; OL1 trips if it faults.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Hold SB1 to start, hold SB0 to stop.\nClick ES1 (E-Stop) and click it again.\nSelect Belt01 and press Fault: OL1 trips,\nH3 and HA1 come on. Reset OL1.

